  <VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.17>asatruLessonIntro-&gt; 聆聽奧丁,全能之父從烏爾德之井低語所說的話:</VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.17>
  <VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.18>asatruLessonIntro-&gt;Lo, Völuspá的詩句向所有願意聆聽的人宣佈:</VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.18>
  <VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.19>asatruLessonIntro-&gt; 在雷神的錘子被擊中時注意它,因為它教導:</VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.19>
  <VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.20>asatruLessonIntro-&gt; Hark,烏鴉胡金和穆寧圈並哭出他們的真理來:</VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.20>
  <VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.21>asatruLessonIntro-&gt; 在伊格德拉西爾的陰影下,眾神確實聚集並宣佈:</VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.21>
  <VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.22>asatruLessonIntro-&gt;B 以巴爾德所賜之光,知道這一點:</VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.22>
  <VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.23>asatruLessonIntro-&gt; 關於&quot;九大世界&quot;的峽灣,智慧迴響,說:</VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.23>
  <VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.24>asatruLessonIntro-&gt; 刻入米德加德石塊的遺蹟這樣教導我們:</VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.24>
  <VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.25>asatruLessonReinforcement-&gt;願你們的行為在瓦爾哈拉的大廳中迴響。</VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.25>
  <VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.26>asatruLessonReinforcement-&gt;. 諾斯人用榮耀的線織出你的命運.</VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.26>
  <VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.27>asatruLessonReinforcement-&gt;Stand Stand complete, 為眾神獎勵勇氣和決心.</VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.27>
  <VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.28>asatruLessonReinforcement-&gt;Hail, 由於您所做的事會激發人們的歌聲。</VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.28>
  <VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.29>asatruLessonReinforcement-&gt;. 托爾之錘為那些堅持真理和力量的人祝福.</VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.29>
  <VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.30>asatruLessonReinforcement-&gt;. 全能父親看那些尊重老道的人.</VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.30>
  <VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.31>asatruLessonReinforcement-&gt; 願您在親屬關係的神聖紐帶中找到勝利。</VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.31>
  <VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.32>lessonReinforcement-&gt; 所以這個故事會繼續發展下去。</VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.32>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.0>intro-&gt;[introprefix], [introsuffix] 單位 [place_name],則 [place_adjective] 和解和 [place_summary]倖存者找到一個脆弱的立足點。</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.0>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.1>introprefix-&gt; 炸彈倒下後舊世界倒塌後</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.1>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.10>crisis(uses=2)-&gt; 星辰號跟蹤他們的定居點,迫使絕望地在已知的邊界以外進行尋回.</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.10>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.11>crisis(uses=2)-&gt;Radiation風暴橫掃了土地,毒害了地和心,考驗了他們的決心。</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.11>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.12>crisis(uses=2)-&gt; 潛伏於黑暗中的被混入了魔獸和扭曲的恐怖,威脅了每一個步驟.</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.12>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.13>crisis(uses=2)-&gt; 內部衝突使他們的團結受到破壞,因為倖存者中恐懼和懷疑日增。</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.13>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.14>crisis(uses=2)-&gt;昔日戰爭的鬼魂在被摧毀的城市中呼應 敵對派別爭奪權力的崩潰 [place_powerCenter].</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.14>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.15>crisis(uses=2)-&gt; 由輻射和汙穢所生出的各種瓦斯泰蘭疾病橫掃了整個社群,聲稱年輕人和老人一樣,看不到治癒方法。</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.15>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.16>crisis(uses=2)-&gt; 不穩定水源乾涸或被下毒,迫使去遙遠,未知的綠洲進行危險的行走.</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.16>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.17>crisis(uses=2)-&gt; 天空被灰和火暴所燒,將太陽抹去並冷卻出地至骨深的寒冷.</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.17>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.18>crisis(uses=2)-&gt;Rival 戰帶發動了無情的突襲,夷平了農場和村莊,分散了家庭並粉碎了脆弱的聯盟.</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.18>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.19>crisis(uses=2)-&gt; 世界老技術動搖和崩潰,使倖存者從廢品中拼湊出武器和工具,往往面臨極大的風險。</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.19>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.2>introprefix-&gt; 核火後 核火後</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.2>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.20>crisis(uses=2)-&gt; 一種潛伏的、非自然的威脅的口音——被科學所扭曲的變種人瘋狂地在人民中散佈出恐怖和妄想。</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.20>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.21>response-&gt;[responseprefix], [responsesuffix] 環繞中心,如 [place_community],則 [place_adjective] 人民聚集在一起,包括 [place_job]他保持了脆弱的和平。</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.21>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.22>responseprefix-&gt; 有人轉而走老路</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.22>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.23>responseprefix-&gt;. 領軍者崛起-軍閥.</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.23>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.24>responseprefix-&gt; 他們與周邊團體結成了脆弱的聯盟</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.24>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.25>responseprefix-&gt; 其他擁護殘酷生存主義的人</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.25>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.26>responseprefix-&gt; 宗教邪教和奇異的新信仰蓬勃發展</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.26>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.27>responseprefix-&gt; 熟練的清掃工和工程師重新設計了舊技術</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.27>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.28>responsesuffix-&gt; 包含部落儀式和祖傳靈通以示指導.</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.28>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.29>responsesuffix-&gt;-electioned unions - 每一個委員會都聲稱對人民擁有權力。</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.29>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.3>introprefix-&gt; 大戰留下了比沙漠和廢墟更深的傷疤</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.3>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.30>responsesuffix-&gt; 貿易知識,武器,和希望.</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.30>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.31>responsesuffix-&gt;先出手並毫不留情地對敵人施以憐憫.</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.31>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.32>responsesuffix-&gt;offering 混亂中的意義.</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.32>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.33>responsesuffix-&gt; 來保衛並維持他們的家園.</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.33>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.34>transformation-&gt;[transformationprefix], [transformationsuffix] 他們的大廳,像 [place_powerCenter]成為混亂中秩序的象徵</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.34>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.35>transformationprefix-&gt; 隨著時間的推移,他們的習俗被強化為法律</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.35>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.36>transformationprefix-&gt;. 最初,隨著分散的倖存者成長為一支強大的力量。</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.36>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.37>transformationprefix-&gt; 他們的旗幟在戰場和議會大廳上都升起</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.37>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.38>transformationprefix-&gt;. 一些古城被廢墟所平息</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.38>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.39>transformationprefix-&gt; 艱苦的傷痕給他們留下了烙印</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.39>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.4>introprefix-&gt; 當文明倒下時</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.4>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.40>transformationprefix-&gt; 領導者周圍成長</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.40>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.41>transformationsuffix-&gt; 相會,並不可破誓.</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.41>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.42>transformationsuffix-&gt; 恐懼並尊重廢物。</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.42>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.43>transformationsuffix-&gt; 團結與權力的同名詞.</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.43>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.44>transformationsuffix-&gt; 將衰變為希望堡壘.</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.44>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.45>transformationsuffix-&gt; 造就了一個永遠不會屈從於牆外恐怖的民族.</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.45>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.46>transformationsuffix-&gt;tales 被火光所啟示,啟發後世.</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.46>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.47>legacy-&gt;[legacyprefix], [legacysuffix] 曾經是一群倖存者 [place_name]它們現在證明我們有韌性</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.47>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.48>legacyprefix-&gt; 現在</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.48>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.49>legacyprefix-&gt; 從破碎的起步</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.49>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.5>introsuffix-&gt; 被輻射廢物所活活的倖存者。</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.5>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.50>legacyprefix-&gt; 他們的故事是抗禦力的故事</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.50>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.51>legacyprefix-&gt; 儘管廢物很嚴酷</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.51>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.52>legacyprefix-&gt; 隨著舊世界的消亡</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.52>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.53>legacyprefix-&gt; 時間將判斷他們</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.53>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.54>legacysuffix-&gt; 他們的名字在廢土上呼應,是盟國的燈塔,是敵人的警告。</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.54>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.55>legacysuffix-&gt; 他們刻出新世界的一地,從灰燼中塑造出未來.</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.55>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.56>legacysuffix-&gt;a 證明在毀滅中團結的力量。</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.56>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.57>legacysuffix-&gt; 它們的遺產被活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活活</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.57>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.58>legacysuffix-&gt; 他們的新秩序興起, 在一個野蠻地盤上脆弱的希望。</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.58>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.59>legacysuffix-&gt; 他們作為救世主或怪物站立,但影響是不可否認的。</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.59>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.6>introsuffix-&gt;. 灰燼誕生了新的部落、幫派和定居點,為生存而掙扎。</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.6>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.7>introsuffix-&gt; 出自這些傷疤的新生社群。</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.7>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.8>introsuffix-&gt; 絕望和希望聚集在被摧毀的天空下閃爍的營火上。</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.8>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.9>crisis(uses=2)-&gt;他們與野蠻的突襲者戰鬥 [place_foeLeader],指揮無情 [place_foeSoldiers].</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.9>
